@startuml
!pragma charset UTF-8
title Ring Design, Recommendation and Human Review Swimlane
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #FCF9F8
  BorderColor #807663
  ArrowColor #5B5E67
}

|Guest|
start
:Open public design or custom-request entry;
:Browse preview and public explanation;
:Select protected action;
:Sign-in prompt;
stop

|Member|
start
:Open workshop ring designer;
:Choose model or blank design;
:Configure parameters;
|System|
:Validate catalogue options and limits;
if (Save/evaluate valid?) then (yes)
  :Persist design version;
  :Calculate advisory difficulty and recommendation;
  |Member|
  :View recommendation without forced booking;
  if (Consult staff?) then (yes)
    :Open context-linked consultation;
  endif
  if (Create custom design request?) then (yes)
    :Attach optional saved-design snapshot;
    :Add description and/or up to five images;
    :Give image consent;
    |System|
    :Validate request and image quality;
    :Create NEED_REVIEW request;
    |Staff or Manager|
    :Inspect request and reference material;
    if (Decision?) then (clarification)
      :Request clarification with explanation;
      |Member|
      :Update request context and submit clarification;
      |System|
      :Return request to NEED_REVIEW;
      |Staff or Manager|
      :Review clarified request;
      :Accept or reject with explanation;
    else (accept or reject)
      :Accept or reject with explanation;
    endif
    |System|
    :Persist mandatory explanation and audit event;
    |Member|
    :Read status and explanation;
    if (Accepted?) then (yes)
      |Staff or Manager|
      :Prepare custom-order quote;
      |Manager|
      :Approve quote;
      |Member|
      :Pay the full approved amount before quote expiry;
      |System|
      :Verify payment and activate production;
      |Staff or Manager|
      :Advance production and fulfilment;
      |Member|
      :View handover or delivery completion;
    endif
  endif
else (no)
  :Show validation or version conflict;
endif
stop

note right
There is no Feature-012 branch selection or booking attachment.
AI does not analyze reference images or make design decisions.
An accepted request is not an order until the quote is approved and paid in full.
end note
@enduml
